    ["召唤<HighLight>2</>个神的雕像；雕像周围<HighLight>1</>格友军最大生命值提升<HighLight>30%</>、伤害提升<HighLight>22%</>；【神弃之地】棋子额外获得<HighLight>50%</>效果。准备阶段离开范围立即失效；战斗开始后离开范围仍持续<HighLight>45</>秒，同类效果不叠加。"] = "Summon <HighLight>2</> God statues; allies within <HighLight>1</> tile of the statue gain <HighLight>30%</> maximum Health and <HighLight>22%</> Damage Increase; [Forsaken Land of the Gods] pieces gain an additional <HighLight>50%</> effect. The effect is lost immediately upon leaving the range during the preparation phase; after battle starts, the effect persists for <HighLight>45</> seconds after leaving the range. Similar effects do not stack.",
