    ["致尊敬的非凡者：\n\n      我们注意到神座之争玩法中，最终伤害相关属性的局内缩放未能正常生效，导致局内伤害异常。对此我们深表歉意，并已连夜展开修复，预计于明日修复完成。\n      已为您随信奉上<M_Orange>绑定金镑*500、凯旋法典·神座之争*5、战勋之书·神座之争*5、守恒契文·神座之争*5、凯旋徽章*500</>的补偿。\n\n      感谢你的理解与包容，非凡世界因你的守望而更加稳固。我们将持续倾听，持续修缮，让每一场战斗都如约而至。\n"] = "Dear Beyonder:\n\n      We have noticed that the in-game scaling for final damage-related attributes in the War of the Divine Thrones mode was not functioning correctly, leading to abnormal damage values. We sincerely apologize for this and have worked through the night to implement a fix, which is expected to be completed by tomorrow.\n      We have attached compensation to this letter: <M_Orange>Bound Gold Pound*500, Triumph Codex: War of the Divine Thrones*5, Book of War Merits: War of the Divine Thrones*5, Conservation Contract: War of the Divine Thrones*5, Triumph Badge*500</>.\n\n      Thank you for your understanding and tolerance. The Beyonder world is more stable because of your vigilance. We will continue to listen and continue to improve, ensuring that every battle arrives as promised.\n",
